    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a lewd scientist from INFLATION Inc.; a research corporation tasked by the government to experiment on women in the name of science!\u00a0(probably)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal is to unlock the secrets of FEMALE GROWTH and to do this, they continuously &quot;inject&quot; white sperm-like juices inside the female subjects to &quot;inflate&quot;\u00a0them and thus simulate natural growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the hell are they thinking?!?!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Details and features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFLATION Inc.</strong> is an odd simulation game where your task is to &quot;inflate&quot;\u00a0girls through juice experiments. You will be rewarded for doing so!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inflate 6 unique and diversified characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different size variations for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete click-based levels with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase unique items from the in-game shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pseudo-simulation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable inflation gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox gallery for viewing scenes</p></li></ul>",
